            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Screenshots check they&#x27;ve got the meeting: an app&#x27;s home screen is dropped and the meeting window found.</li><li>Screenshots while you present: the screen you&#x27;re sharing, until you stop.</li><li>Teams&#x27; and Webex&#x27;s main windows are never mistaken for the meeting; popped-out shared screens are preferred.</li></ul>]]></description>
